---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { getSite } from '../lib/site';

const { securityEmail } = getSite();
---
<Layout
  title="Security"
  description="How Bycon approaches security for our services—overview for customers and prospects evaluating our transport platform."
>
  <article class="prose" style="max-width: 42rem;">
    <h1>Security</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      We design our software for organizations that take compliance and data stewardship seriously. This page summarizes
      our posture at a high level; your order form or agreement may include additional commitments.
    </p>

    <h2>Product and infrastructure</h2>
    <p>
      Our transport management application runs on managed cloud infrastructure with network controls, encryption in
      transit for browser sessions (HTTPS), and access restrictions aligned to operational need. We patch and monitor
      systems as part of normal operations.
    </p>

    <h2>Access and authentication</h2>
    <p>
      Access to production environments and customer data is limited to authorized personnel and tied to business need.
      Customers authenticate to the TMS through application mechanisms defined in the product; we encourage strong
      passwords and role-appropriate permissions inside your organization.
    </p>

    <h2>Data handling</h2>
    <p>
      Trip and operational data belong to your organization’s workflow; we process it to deliver the service you
      subscribed to. Specific retention, subprocessors, and data processing terms may be addressed in your contract or a
      data protection addendum where applicable.
    </p>

    <h2>Vulnerability reports</h2>
    <p>
      If you believe you have found a security issue related to Bycon services, please email us with enough detail to
      reproduce the concern. We appreciate responsible disclosure and will work with you to understand and address valid
      findings.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a href={`mailto:${securityEmail}?subject=Security%20report`}>{securityEmail}</a>
    </p>

    <h2>Limitation</h2>
    <p style="font-size: 0.875rem;">
      No cloud service can guarantee absolute security. This page is informational and may be updated as our practices
      evolve.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
